preConditionHook:
// The prior COMPLETED calendar month's closed-trade result, latched on the
// first bar of each new month. MonthlyProfitTarget is the reference for the
// shape; the differences are deliberate:
//   * equity is NetProfit alone (closed trades), not NetProfit +
//     OpenPositionProfit -- a completed month's result is what was booked;
//   * the reading is of the month that has ENDED, so it never changes inside
//     the month, where MonthlyProfitTarget's running gain does.
// PrevMonth/PrevEquity mirror EL's CurrentMonth[1]/CurrentEquity[1]: an EL
// variable holds its initial 0 before the strategy's first evaluated bar, so
// both start at 0 and the first evaluated bar latches PriorMonthResult = 0 --
// which passes, exactly as the EasyLanguage twin does.
CurrentEquity = ctx.NetProfit();
CurrentMonth = civil_from_days(day_of(ctx.Time(0))).month;
if (CurrentMonth != PrevMonth) {
    PriorMonthResult = PrevEquity - MonthStartEquity;
    MonthStartEquity = PrevEquity;
}
